<h2>Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || "there" %>,</h2>

<p>We tried to process your Parkour Utah subscription payment today, but the card on file was declined. This can happen if a card expired, was replaced, or the billing details changed.</p>

<p><strong>To keep your subscription active, please visit <%= link_to "your account subscriptions page", account_url(tab: "subscriptions") %> and click "Update Billing Info" to add a new card.</strong> Your card details are stored securely by our payment processor - we never see or store them ourselves. As soon as your new card is on file, we'll retry the payment and your student's access will resume without a gap.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please reply to this email and we'll be happy to help.</p>

<p>- The Parkour Utah team</p>
